  "RawString": "<html style=\"font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; width:800px; height:800px; margin:0 auto; padding:0;\">\n\t<head>\n\t  <title>[email[subject]]</title>\n       <style>\n          *   {  font-size: 12px; font-family: \"Roboto,sans-serif\"; color: #2b3032; }\n          a  { color: #214A71; cursor: pointer; }\n          hr { border-top: solid 1px #ccc; }\n\t\t</style>\n\t</head>\n\t<body style=\"width: 800px; padding: 30px; margin:20px; auto; padding:0;\">\n\t\t<header>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"[app[root]]\"><img src=\"[api[root]]Core/App([app[id]])/DMS/Content/CompanyLogo.png\" alt=\"[app[name]]\" title=\"[app[name]]\" height=\"80\" width=\"325\" style=\"display:block\" /></a>\n\t\t\t<h2 style=\"background: #1E3B69; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 5px; font-size: 140%;\">[email[subject]]</h2>           \n\t\t</header>\n\t\t<div style=\"margin: 10px auto; padding: 5px 40px;\">\n            <p>[resource_displayname[Greeting]]</p>\n            <p>Your onboarding request can be approved.</p>\n        </div>\n\t\t<div style=\"background-color: #1E3B69; color: white; width: 100%;\"><p style=\" padding: 10px; text-align: right; background: #1E3B69; color: white;\">&copy; 2020, Corporate LinX Limited</p></div>\n\t</body>\n</html>",
